{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c8387522cb235784d111ed79f189f5945f3e767d790ca48cdbe7f6cae38fd467", "ja": "いつもは仲良しな亜美と真美だが、センター\nの座を巡って争いが勃発。センキョ対決だと\n劇場を占拠する。仲間達を巻き込みながら、\nふたりの戦いはステージに。競演を終えたふ\nたりは大満足、結果はうやむやに。", "zh": "平时关系很好的亚美与真美，却为了争夺\nC位的位置爆发了冲突。她们以“选秀对决”\n为名占领了剧场。随着将伙伴们卷入其中，\n两人的战斗转移到了舞台上。完成同台竞演的\n两人心满意足，结果也就不了了之了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1000_p", "source_sha256": "321cb0bdeeb71784e9d10a3b0f3fd46f63b56654786c5de8d2645dc6ad9295bb", "ja": "（あれから数日。亜美と真美は、ケンカではない方法で\n決着をつけるといってくれたが……何をする気だろう）", "zh": "（几天后。亜美和真美说要用不吵架的方式分出胜负，可是……她们打算做什么呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "a9e3f4c8b9c600acedeecb0f6f8befeb3ae9f06b3963a55905e68db660081277", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n大変、大変です～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n不得了，不得了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4fd056827b36cbb046d51a66935f21ac1593374bfbf73a3d0712cecc00a88170", "ja": "可奈？　それにひなたも。\nそんなに慌てて、どうした？", "zh": "可奈？还有ひなた。你们这么慌慌张张的，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "a36ae4816786165acfe0398ca04b410394f34dc1961ad261a8026dac584c7bea", "ja": "亜美シショーと真美センセーが、\nエントランスをせーふくしちゃったべさ！", "zh": "亚美师父和真美老师，把入口给征服了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1004_p", "source_sha256": "87cf1db34be851bd06b7c9a9975c7d05c0dfc56731353ba6441c93ed1ee3f61c", "ja": "なんだって？\nつまり……どういうことだ！？", "zh": "什么？\n也就是说……到底是怎么回事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "87751b7198b1cea8670371a5d8eaf5e6f0e6322b3643474983b28176f81adc68", "ja": "いまどきのアイドルと言えば、\n総センキョがつきものだー！", "zh": "说到现在的偶像，就少不了总选举啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "12d815ef95fca2cd5935eaaf6411508527bdb009e68b73b573ca3da84ebaf2e1", "ja": "というわけで、真美たちはセンキョ活動を始める！\nセンキョ対決で、決着をつけるのだー！", "zh": "所以说，真美她们要开始竞选活动了！  \n通过选举对决，一决胜负吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "179780f33ac33c95421a8fb353abeafd8914de47b660e04456e710b9a216cd6c", "ja": "マイクテス、マイクテス。えー、ワレワレは～、\n諸君の惜しみない支持と投票を～、要求するぞ～。", "zh": "麦克风测试，麦克风测试。呃——我们要求各位毫不吝惜地支持我们、投我们一票哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "ec8d94d11d5d624150d660bff50ea5c798bf62ca1a7a31e3b7635058a7412e21", "ja": "そんでもってジユウとカイホウと～、\nオヤツとゲームとお年玉を要求するぞ～。", "zh": "然后还要自由和解放～以及零食、游戏和压岁钱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1009_p", "source_sha256": "73a8adc3776e7089a7ede8153ec3422ffd42cb2a21c48b491fdd4be9bce70ce4", "ja": "くっ、なんてワガママな要求なんだ……！\nふたりとも、なんのマネだ！？", "zh": "唔，这要求也太任性了……！\n你们两个，到底想干什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "ea2e2c214e6c20c0ea9e1c87d3c81d0d2f2a85c86fecd88d2cd7436c071cc02c", "ja": "次のセンキョ場所から、対決スタートだかんね。\nはい！　給湯室は真美の陣地～！", "zh": "接下来从争夺地点开始对决哦。\n好！茶水间是真美的地盘～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "85ef2ac54ce3f63b5c424af43e1c2a04a9977a3d7e0a112763e1574f5f41e489", "ja": "うあうあ、冷蔵庫はズルいよ～！？\nんじゃ、亜美は事務室ね。ゲームは全部亜美の！", "zh": "哇啊哇啊，占了冰箱太耍赖了吧～！？\n那亚美就要办公室。游戏全都是亚美的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "1be167e921f2934eed46f696af9afb4c9e476dc9dd47c7229ccdfd040ce36a83", "ja": "えー！？\n真美、まだナムドラクリアしてないのに～！！", "zh": "诶——！？\n真美明明还没通关《南梦宫英雄传》呢～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "efc1dcf2c774b66e8e32601407f7d242e65a25df57955a867f65f89257bd3bda", "ja": "……ひなたちゃん。\nあれって、どういうルールなの？", "zh": "……日向。\n那个到底是什么规则呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "9daaca0eaad42cdf3798dcc1b562fcf212aab4dfc43ef1cd5c24d46b906a5c8a", "ja": "や～。亜美シショーと真美センセーのいうことは、\n難しくてねぇ。", "zh": "哎～。亚美师傅和真美老师说的话，\n深奥着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1015_p", "source_sha256": "79f11a5f80f601359a5ae780c97a04ba2b27e3a7e5f9303b0b109f20d17efc55", "ja": "ルールがあるんだろうか……。ああ、そういえば\n今日は、律子が営業の日……。狙ったな？", "zh": "难道还有什么规则吗……啊，对了，今天是律子外出工作的日子……你是故意的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "893680a2f434f4fbc4a1ca601a4a36962864c7dbf6af03848af46f7693fb5c3f", "ja": "続いて、亜美はレッスンルームを陣地とする！\nここで鍛えたナカマを増やすのだー！", "zh": "接下来，亜美就把练习室占为自己的地盘！\n要在这里增加一起锻炼过的伙伴啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "bf57ad4c0195ec8bb5048a32796e4f6c1201b47c80df080aff2969531799e2e5", "ja": "んじゃ、真美は受付を支配する！\nんっふっふ～、チケット発行し放題♪", "zh": "那真美就占领前台！\n嗯哼哼～，想发多少张票都行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "8194113efbe127db53d70c9ad2d64a657e8477b57a7b9560e20af544260a3f33", "ja": "ふたりとも、どうしたんだろう……？\nいつも一緒で、いつも仲良しなのに……。", "zh": "你们两个这是怎么了……？\n明明总是形影不离、关系也一直很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "fbdad406b14986fbe18efea22267904dd4b9d1c7df2bdb424750759134465f00", "ja": "あ、あのね、真美センセー。どうしてこんなことを？\nこのままだと、劇場を開けられないよぉ？", "zh": "啊、那个，真美老师。为什么会这样呢？\n这样下去，剧场就没法开门了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "2318230e25c831c1a64c2da9febedfd42d7b2c7fa3a0561a60efbb9914f1fc5b", "ja": "あっ、ひなぴー発見！\nひなぴーは真美の味方だよね♪", "zh": "啊，发现小日向了！\n小日向是站在真美这边的，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "fb6a04255af48360a86ed39cbb8830322d49d4e0f17cdc29dc7b281042b539cc", "ja": "ええっ？　味方って、どういうことだい？", "zh": "诶诶？你说的“自己人”是什么意思呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "01f23ac199e2758339465929d059b9c66a72254e148b88f12654e97c1d1ac2f7", "ja": "どうもこうも、ひなぴーは真美チームってこと！\nほら、あとで特典のボンサイあげるから～☆", "zh": "还能是什么意思，雏P就是真美队的人啦！看嘛，之后给你特典盆栽哦～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "fac4d842b8385c1bc4e69e657771ad620c5fd8e7eeff4fcf68b9696cc33a3b9c", "ja": "そ、そうかい？　ボンサイをくれるなら、\nそういうことでも……いいかなぁ？", "zh": "这、这样啊？要是会给我盆栽，那样也……没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "bc74073ee5a4e342e55ba888d7cf27af3d1b6bcddb4181137e85ab319ca5db0e", "ja": "よいではないか、よいではないか～。てことで、\n真美チームの木下ひなたサンによる、応援演説です。", "zh": "这不是很好嘛，这不是很好嘛～。所以呢，下面是由真美团队的木下日向先生带来的拉票演说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "4f87dea9a6f8924c270ec683b3880b9a3a8e3e8f1b10f2af5f170801db3fa672", "ja": "う、うん。ええと……真美センセーは、元気で面白くて\nかわいくって、ええと……スゴイ人なんだよぉ♪", "zh": "呜、嗯。那个……真美老师，既有活力又有趣，\n还很可爱，那个……是个很厉害的人哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9e66fb475c707973c343f7b8f23da6f0b5b2f86413fb96beb631d09f0ac5445d", "ja": "（しまった……なんだかよくわからないうちに、\nひなたが真美に取り込まれてしまった……！）", "zh": "（糟了……不知不觉间，日向已经被真美带跑了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "e99cd73568d2ccd3c0140ad94cb6256f06a5ff2098a5efbb5bda39a93448ef99", "ja": "ううっ……ね、ねえ、亜美ちゃん？\n落ち着いて、よく聞いて欲しいな。", "zh": "呜呜……那、那个，亚美？\n你先冷静下来，听我说嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "b00071546696e703eeff74c114201c8058388c3237399b8ec59ecbf76387dc64", "ja": "私、いっぱい歌の練習しなくちゃいけないから……。\nだから、レッスンルームを解放して……。", "zh": "我还有好多歌要练习……\n所以，把练习室让给我吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1029_011ami", "source_sha256": "75325b24854505e77d3dd638b3a9fa366e73fa07c0857e9c3cc69142956cf3ee", "ja": "かなり～ん！　最初はグー！\nジャンケンポン！　あっちむいてホイ！", "zh": "可奈——！先出石头！\n石头剪刀布！看那边！-backward?", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "38c4fc3d6a2db378225df1ede75fa16b38481e5f8400e2b16f8b8d56efc1dff1", "ja": "えっ、あっ、ポン！　ホイ！　……はれっ！？\nあと出しなのに、つられて負けちゃった！？", "zh": "咦、啊、出拳！嘿！……哎！？  \n明明是后出，怎么还跟着输了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "17d898df09b63a4a566202e40c01d0e6f916c9d2819bfcc13f6797eccbd1a649", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　これでかなりんは亜美チーム☆\n……亜美の応援ソング、歌ってくれるね？", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪ 这样一来可奈就归亚美队了☆\n……你会给亚美唱应援歌的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "ed4b6a86b18780c0cda4c5c25ffe2426568a61b487a80b1d1e469d5f0313f205", "ja": "あ、ハイ。えっとえっと……おほん！　エコなアイドル\n亜美ちゃんは～♪　ラブリ～カワイイ～エブリデイ～♪", "zh": "啊，好的。那个那个……咳咳！环保偶像\n亚美～♪ 可爱～又可爱～每一天～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1033_p", "source_sha256": "13bca7571caa3b1ae66c5ec4f902a57d0cbca5f3de884a50024774ce6fd235d0", "ja": "（今度は可奈が亜美に……くっ、人を巻き込むことに\n関しては、どこまで才能にあふれてるんだ……！）", "zh": "（这次轮到可奈对亚美……可恶，在把别人卷进来这方面，她到底有多么有天赋啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "4801e399a836ebd91776ad186e00298eda3e1549e20fd3b92146fbd66164a5b6", "ja": "ん……{$P$}さん。\nなんの、騒ぎ……？", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}先生。\n在吵、什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "8e26800f48849c4a05f34f77456f0da536df1ea58ae184ad4d86e5c496b79589", "ja": "あっ、もっちーだ！　もっちー！\nこっちこっち！　真美のモンモンにくだるのだー！", "zh": "啊，是小望！小望！\n这边这边！到真美的“蒙蒙”里来吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "4b23ba8e1bec7ccb966c40f1214c5428f64e0ef13d56a5af9c47a8cf5fd6124f", "ja": "こっちだよ、亜美んとこ来てよ～！\n真美んとこ行ったらボンサイにされちゃうよ？", "zh": "这边啦，快到亚美这儿来嘛～！要是去了真美那边，可是会被做成盆栽的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "9263f592b95079ccc8a115f32f2b958a0e745ded64d6ebdb05381ba37bc979c9", "ja": "？？　亜美ちゃん、真美ちゃんも……何してるの？", "zh": "？？亚美姐姐、真美姐姐……你们在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1038_p", "source_sha256": "cf2c8511acbe44667faa1aaaf9458057ce9e40ba87cab27030ac504fb81ce48c", "ja": "待て杏奈、ふたりに近づいちゃダメだ！\n実は、かくかくしかじかで……！", "zh": "等一下杏奈，不能靠近她们两个！\n其实事情是这样那样的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1039_024ann", "source_sha256": "cf26516ca78387fb5b16f7d2c6d397d5522352317ac7ed8ca00ef5df6c4ed12f", "ja": "あの……よく、わかんないけど……\nふたりとも……ケンカは、ダメ。", "zh": "那个……虽然我不是很明白……\n你们两个……不能吵架。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1040_012mam", "source_sha256": "65dafbb996375175f8deb645f1fe825ed261851a87ba6c37455e68071bdecbed", "ja": "ケンカじゃないよ～！　これはね、\nゲンセーでシンセーなセンキョ対決！", "zh": "不是吵架啦～！这是用严肃又神圣的选举对决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1041_011ami", "source_sha256": "39d283322393ab3f806db142e89f553851cfaf0de8cc01c390a63862b7dfc895", "ja": "そうだよ、コーメーでセーダイな、\nえーっと、なんかそーゆーの！", "zh": "对呀，就是光明正大、盛大隆重的……呃，反正就是那种东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "5ab30a95fb39724ffe8cb3d15e2bd34f629309f2b27849319a57ded514082d93", "ja": "でも、杏奈……ふたりの\nどっちかとか、選べない……。", "zh": "可是，杏奈……没办法在两个人中选一个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1043_024ann", "source_sha256": "1a7a5bcb05c529d44f59e2292c7e7683be87662dcb07f25be4ad971522c7b3bf", "ja": "だって杏奈、ふたりとも……好き、です。", "zh": "因为杏奈……两个都喜欢……所以，选不出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1044_011ami", "source_sha256": "0bc3f0d380d3e709d613db39595acfc74f158d9c1071f7b6a2b68c515a9fe6f0", "ja": "はきゅーん……！", "zh": "哈啾——……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
