{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1046_012mam", "source_sha256": "964a1e131c39401de28617ec2cf484782ab868dcef46726c38cdad737e0bb28b", "ja": "あああ、びっくりした～。\nキュン死するかと思った～。はあ、はあ。", "zh": "啊啊啊，吓我一跳～。\n我还以为自己要心动过度死掉了～。呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1047_011ami", "source_sha256": "e6d743573a8f533c89dd5b0cdfc3fb7eb0856b58d304936a7e16f6fe21dd3095", "ja": "さすがもっちー、\nかいしんのキュン撃だったよ～。はあ、はあ。", "zh": "不愧是小望，刚才那一下心动暴击真够劲～哈啊，哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1048_p", "source_sha256": "e7eea74fb22ff1a2e474f1800611d77faac359c5447019466173f690820835ad", "ja": "よし今だ！　はい、ちょっと休戦！\n亜美も真美も、ブレイク！　ブレイク！　な？", "zh": "好，就是现在！好了，先暂时休战一下！\n亚美、真美，都休息！休息！好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
