{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1051_036kan", "source_sha256": "87cd44480c63e0b006703c2140e302971ff461f7b94d6387cbc655d8ddfd1ad8", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さん。\nこの対決、ほんとに決着つくんですか？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生。\n这场对决，真的能分出胜负吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1052_035hin", "source_sha256": "73db9468f3a7f7f31987f7e3851b9fa187f4336e68f8d26bb9b5235741b9c9ee", "ja": "あたしもつい、つられちゃったけども……\nどうなったら終わるんだい？", "zh": "我也不小心被带着起劲了，不过……\n到底要怎样才算结束啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1053_p", "source_sha256": "fe8d3126e2d3bfa015b7399ebf8f4524954f494fda945adbd4b4a6e69d3ff3c0", "ja": "ごめんな、ふたりとも。\nそれは俺も知りたいんだ……。", "zh": "抱歉啊，你们俩。\n这个我也想知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1054_024ann", "source_sha256": "8c9a487c21e914b2bc34e378e4ad227bd6974dc29deecdce4b74a2a3b36667be", "ja": "んと……。\n今やってるのは……陣取りゲーム？", "zh": "那个……  \n现在玩的是……抢地盘游戏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1055_011ami", "source_sha256": "3dfc4624323f4e3c29a898d0bc449d0994014b89ad937d61ade9a718cd38631d", "ja": "そうそう、\n手に汗握る駆け引き、アツいバトル！", "zh": "对对，\n这可是让人捏一把汗的策略较量，超热血的战斗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1056_024ann", "source_sha256": "86c751f1508f49aeb2890f4d24db79db6bfd4dcde54ea121df79b8847bca797a", "ja": "このまま、劇場の場所を……\n取っていく、ゲーム？", "zh": "就这样，把剧场的场地……一个个抢走的游戏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1057_012mam", "source_sha256": "f086a14bc5fbab71f47b2e87853bce7beae6226a84c8515a91cad9bee9fd6727", "ja": "そうそう、取りきるまでは終わらないよ？\n取りきった後のコトは、そのとき考えるけど♪", "zh": "对对，在全部拿下来之前是不会结束的哦？\n至于拿完之后的事，到时候再想就是了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1058_024ann", "source_sha256": "fbdcb02f6f3fbde6d5e639c4124b9b0b7366b8c4d31e2d0dfb3a8b7a75799b64", "ja": "なら……きっと累計ポイント多い方が勝ち、だよね。\n一番ポイント高いのは……どこ？", "zh": "那么……累计积分更多的人获胜，对吧。\n积分最高的是……哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1059_011ami", "source_sha256": "2d891e40c8ca1e8ee34e73b7544eae76f0d48d291343603d1d05160f2ecc46f0", "ja": "決まってるっしょ！\n劇場のステージだよね、真美？", "zh": "当然是剧场的舞台啦！真美，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1060_012mam", "source_sha256": "2a08e2a06c9ddbd462707dd2282c4c071467183d7fb0fdb03e43db455808b639", "ja": "そうだよ～。だって真美たち、アイドルだし。\nステージにクンリンするモノ、それこそが……", "zh": "就是嘛～。因为真美她们可是偶像啊。君临舞台的存在，那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1061_011ami", "source_sha256": "b7f1f5d10913816b1372f74872414b293915c0556eaf8cf894d3fc563e4d6d0f", "ja": "真のスターなのだ！", "zh": "这才是真正的巨星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
