{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1069_036kan", "source_sha256": "42c43427a22fcf51b4478263aac26a650049dd6282de79331df23480402e70a3", "ja": "あは♪　とっても素敵なゲームな気がしてきちゃった！\nわかったよ亜美ちゃん。私、がんばって応援する！", "zh": "啊哈♪感觉这是个非常棒的游戏呢！\n知道了，亚美。我会努力为你加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1070_024ann", "source_sha256": "04c66a7c3c5d45625dbb8f4ea486b884b287b69b9bac23894209aa629770be6b", "ja": "でも……やっぱり、勝ちそうな方を決めるの、\nむずかしそう……。", "zh": "可是……果然还是很难决定哪一方看起来会赢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1071_p", "source_sha256": "1407447d4cc72b4da609f2fd46a27fce369d049d3b86accf1c5f61fd622b9945", "ja": "そうだな。でもまあ、ふたりの気持ちは分かった。\nだから……それならいっそ、こうしよう！", "zh": "是啊。不过，我明白你们两个人的心情了。\n所以……既然这样，干脆就这么办吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_1072", "source_sha256": "b423868f6354efc18d7df7f99f4bf84d26c1a7020ed652980f030d55e492d377", "ja": "決着はステージで！", "zh": "在舞台上一决胜负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e7ddeb4f56a78c32a3a105effe2bb65cf9ab78fd40d50ba78759e355fec0cabe", "ja": "どちらにスターの資格があるのか。\n今度の公演は、それを決めるステージにしよう！", "zh": "谁才有资格成为明星。  \n就把下次的演出办成决出胜负的舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_2001_011ami", "source_sha256": "cf19945875ed6c1957189695de68282ab98c815ba583e6cdc0fc06538b800c00", "ja": "おおっ！　いいね兄ちゃん、アツいね！\nもー、なんで最初からそう言ってくんないかなー？", "zh": "哦哦！不错嘛，哥哥，真热血！\n真是的，为什么不一开始就这么说嘛——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_2002_012mam", "source_sha256": "43918fd65247f8af853fc6eaad85075d6ae47ab988dcd1c7f48d0045a84d5a08", "ja": "うんうん、決着はステージの上でっ。\nそういうコトなら、真美も乗っかってあげるね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，胜负就在舞台上分出吧。\n既然这样，那真美也来帮你一把♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_2003_p", "source_sha256": "14dc812752752f3f9b2eba47c6368bcb70dc6edf8318b7a50b260f57ffd505aa", "ja": "なんで上から目線なんだ？　……でも、よかった！\nじゃあ、そういうことで頼む！", "zh": "为什么一副高高在上的口气啊？……不过，太好了！\n那就这么说定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_057_2004_024ann", "source_sha256": "41c347cbcb3cbc02633d317a9f8924c2a80b92985119cde3cf838a319add453f", "ja": "ふたりで一緒に歌って……\nお客さんに投票とか、してもらう？", "zh": "两个人一起唱歌……\n然后让客人投票之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
